    "_postman_id": "ef99782d-306f-4e64-87fb-82af92290293",
    "name": "LibraryService API",
    "description": "Run-friendly collection for exercising the LibraryService REST API. Requests are ordered to create reusable author, genre, and book IDs, then clean them up at the end. Set `baseUrl` if the API is not running on localhost:3000. Set `openaiApiKey` to exercise the BYOK suggestion endpoints; if it is blank, suggestion requests verify the expected 400 response instead.",
